WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Crouching heavy punch starts the juggle.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.500
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.600
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the juggle.

4
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.250
Luke activates Vulcan Blast under the falling Ryu.

5
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.400
Vulcan Blast completes the juggle.

6
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.350
Ryu lands away from Luke after level one.
